From 6d4a637396da01f8df0590464514f4e9697d52e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:05:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): isolate PR observations and contain failed
 futures [daveey]

Review: pop completed futures before reading results; any ordinary observer exception is unknown CI, not a dispatcher failure. Keep final head refresh isolated from dispatch-owned state dictionaries. Allow shorter operator caps without exceeding 35 minutes.

Proof: fail-first exception/cap and real-pool tests; 45 focused tests green; 10 review mutants killed including head, publication identity, database and clear_cache keys. All 21 scripts/check gates pass. The conservative observation age includes reaping delay, deliberately rejecting old green data rather than extending its lifetime.
